
            ### 📋 Installation Guide:
            #### **Download the Zip File**:
               - Navigate to the Release Page and Download the Correct Zip File for your Device and Kernel Version
               - Ensure that you Select the File that Matches your Device's Model and the Kernel Version you're Installing

            ───────────────────────────────────────────────
  
            #### **Prepare Your Device**:
               - Make sure your Device has an **Unlocked Bootloader** and a Compatible Custom Recovery (TWRP or OrangeFox)
               - It's Recommended to **Backup your Data** Before Proceeding with the Installation to Avoid any Loss

            ───────────────────────────────────────────────

            #### **Install through Recovery Tool**:
               - Reboot your device into **Recovery Mode** (TWRP/OrangeFox/etc.).
               - In the Recovery Menu, Select **Install** and Navigate to the Downloaded Zip File
               - Select the Zip File and Swipe to Confirm Installation
               - After the Installation Completes, Reboot your Device into the System

            #### **Installation via KernelFlasher App**:
               - **Download KernelFlasher**: Get the **KernelFlasher** App from [KernelFlasher GitHub](https://github.com/fatalcoder524/KernelFlasher)
               - **Launch KernelFlasher**: Open the App and Make Sure your **Device is Rooted**
               - **Select Kernel**: Choose the Downloaded **Kernel Zip** File within the App
               - **Flash the Kernel**: Follow the Prompts to Flash the Kernel Directly onto your Device
               - **Reboot**: After Flashing, the App will Reboot the Device into the System

            #### **Installation via Horizon Flasher App**:
               - **Download Horizon Flasher**: Download the **Horizon Flasher App** from [HorizonKernelFlasher GitHub](https://github.com/libxzr/HorizonKernelFlasher/releases) 
               - **Install the App**: Once the App is Installed, Launch it and Select the **Downloaded Kernel Zip** File
               - **Flash**: App will Automatically Flash the Kernel for you... It may Take some Time, Depending on the Size of the Kernel File
               - **Reboot the System**: After Flashing, App will Prompt you to Reboot... Follow the On-Screen Instructions to Reboot into the System   

            ───────────────────────────────────────────────
       
            #### **For Troubleshooting**:
               - If you Encounter any Issues with the Installation or Booting, Here are some Common Fixes:
                  - **Bootloops**: If your Device is Stuck in a Bootloop after Installation, Try Clearing the Cache and Dalvik Cache from the Recovery Menu
                  - **Kernel Panic**: This may occur if your device is incompatible with the Kernel, Try Reverting to a Different Kernel Version or Check for Device-Specific Patches
                  - **Stuck on Recovery**: If you can’t Boot into the System after Installation, Reflash the Recovery and Reattempt the Installation

            ───────────────────────────────────────────────

            #### **Additional Tips**:
               - **Root Access**: If you Need Root Access, Ensure that the Corresponding Root Manager (`SukiSU-Ultra`, `ReSukiSU`, Etc) is Installed after Flashing the Kernel, Follow the Specific Instructions Provided by the Root Manager's Documentation

            ───────────────────────────────────────────────
         
            #### **Common Issues and Fixes**:
               - **Issue - Kernel Does Not Boot**:
                  - Fix: Make Sure you are Using a Kernel Compatible with your Device, Review the Device-Specific Kernel Settings or Check if there are any Custom Patches Required for your Device Model  

            ───────────────────────────────────────────────

            #### **After Installation**:
               - Once Installed, you can Verify the Kernel Version and Root Access by Using a Kernel Checker App or a Root Checker App from the Play Store
               - Enjoy the New Kernel Features and Enhancements Designed to Improve your Device's Performance         

